-- A synthetic store written by the home connector's own fixture builder
-- (packages/connect/calendar/apple/test/fixture.ts), dumped, read by the Mac domain's tests and sealed
-- into the connector's changes fixture (packages/connect/calendar/apple/test/changes-bundle.zip).
-- Every value is fake.
